9cecd056 (951 1792354479496 "guenchi" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f308") (src . "reduce: the declaration tables indexed by name, replayed in linear time\n\nThe three declaration tables (relations, rules, derived relations) were association lists\ntouched at the front on every record, a linear search and rebuild per record, so a replay of\nN declarations cost N squared. One table type holds them now: a hashtable by name with a\ntouch counter, so a lookup is constant, the snapshot rows keep their order (the last touched\nfirst) and a restore keeps its reversal, a reset makes fresh tables, and a clone copies them,\nsince a rehearsal now writes in place. No reader outside the reducer sees a difference.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 419))))
